    "body": "Merged `main` (U9, U10, U11). Ready for a re-check.\n\n- Merge commit: `ac1117a6d`. No rebase and no force-push.\n- Hand-resolved hunks: one. The module doc comment in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tool_library_dialog/mod.rs` had a #4335 (U9) note from `main` and a #4338 (U12) note from this PR at the same place. The merge keeps the two notes (U9 first, then U12).\n- All other files merged automatically. This includes the `mod` lines in `tool_library_dialog/mod.rs` and the test `mod` list in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests.rs`.\n- `git diff origin/main --stat` lists only the files of this PR.\n- The U10 changes in `side_view.rs` and `preview.rs` apply to the tool editor only. The Holders page and the holder form do not use them, so the screenshots do not change.\n- `#[test]` count of `crates/ui`: 2007 (main 2000, plus the 7 new tests of this PR).\n- Gate on head `ac1117a6d` (lane mac-1, pool): `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main`: 22 steps, 0 failed, 0 stalled. `cargo clippy -p camcraft-tools -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- The PR keeps its ready flag (AGENTS.md #3727).\n",
